#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=Canvas
comment0.text=\r\n\ Canvas\ que\ permite\ realizar\ dibujos\ graficos\ simples.\r\n\ Se\ utiliza\ como\ soporte\ grafico\ para\ las\ figuras\ del\ paquete\ shapes.\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Bruce\ Quig\r\n\ @author\ Michael\ Kolling\r\n\ @version\ 1.6\ (shapes)\r\n
comment1.params=
comment1.target=Canvas\ getCanvas()
comment1.text=\r\n\ Devuelve\ la\ instancia\ unica\ del\ canvas.\r\n\r\n\ @return\ instancia\ del\ canvas.\r\n
comment2.params=title\ width\ height\ bgColour
comment2.target=Canvas(java.lang.String,\ int,\ int,\ java.awt.Color)
comment2.text=\r\n\ Crea\ un\ canvas\ con\ titulo,\ dimensiones\ y\ color\ de\ fondo\ indicados.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ title\ titulo\ de\ la\ ventana.\r\n\ @param\ width\ ancho\ del\ canvas.\r\n\ @param\ height\ altura\ del\ canvas.\r\n\ @param\ bgColour\ color\ de\ fondo.\r\n
comment3.params=visible
comment3.target=void\ setVisible(boolean)
comment3.text=\r\n\ Cambia\ la\ visibilidad\ del\ canvas.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ visible\ indica\ si\ el\ canvas\ debe\ ser\ visible.\r\n
comment4.params=referenceObject\ color\ shape
comment4.target=void\ draw(java.lang.Object,\ java.lang.String,\ java.awt.Shape)
comment4.text=\r\n\ Dibuja\ una\ figura\ en\ el\ canvas.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ referenceObject\ objeto\ que\ referencia\ la\ figura.\r\n\ @param\ color\ color\ de\ la\ figura.\r\n\ @param\ shape\ figura\ a\ dibujar.\r\n
comment5.params=referenceObject
comment5.target=void\ erase(java.lang.Object)
comment5.text=\r\n\ Elimina\ una\ figura\ del\ canvas.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ referenceObject\ objeto\ que\ referencia\ la\ figura.\r\n
comment6.params=colorString
comment6.target=void\ setForegroundColor(java.lang.String)
comment6.text=\r\n\ Cambia\ el\ color\ de\ dibujo\ actual.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ colorString\ nombre\ del\ color.\r\n
comment7.params=milliseconds
comment7.target=void\ wait(int)
comment7.text=\r\n\ Detiene\ la\ ejecucion\ durante\ un\ tiempo\ determinado.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ milliseconds\ tiempo\ de\ espera\ en\ milisegundos.\r\n
comment8.params=
comment8.target=void\ redraw()
comment8.text=\r\n\ Redibuja\ todas\ las\ figuras\ del\ canvas.\r\n
comment9.params=
